PARSFILE
#FullDataName Control: Speed (Closed Loop) Using Path Preview`0.7/0.3 G Max Ax/Ay Limits, 120 km/h max`Miscellaneous
INSTALL_DRIVER_SPEED_CONTROLLER CarSim9
#RingCtrl0 2
OPT_SC_SKILL 2
#RingCtrl1 1
#RingCtrl2 1
#RingCtrl3 1
#RingCtrl4 1
#RingCtrl5 1
SPEED_TARGET_COMBINE ADD
SPEED_TARGET_CONSTANT 0
SPEED_AX_THROTTLE_CONSTANT 0.7
SPEED_AX_BRAKE_CONSTANT 0.7
SPEED_AY_LEFT_CONSTANT 0.3
SPEED_AY_RIGHT_CONSTANT 0.3
SPEED_TARGET_S_CONSTANT 120
OPT_SC 4
#CheckBox0 1    
OPT_SC_ENGINE_BRAKING 1
#CheckBox1 0    
#CheckBox2 0    
OPT_SC_3D 0

SPEED_KP 0.5
SPEED_KI 0.1
SPEED_KP3 2.0
BK_PERF_SC 0.1
FPD_PERF_SC 0.1
SPEED_PREVIEW_STEP 4
SPEED_CURV_LENGTH 8
SPEED_PREVIEW_START 0
SPEED_PREVIEW 100
PBK_CON_MAX_SC 10

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This datsaset defines a driving strategy a little more aggressive than seen on the highway.
#
#It is applied for the double-lane change maneuver.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

LOG_ENTRY Used Dataset: Control: Speed (Closed Loop) Using Path Preview; { Miscellaneous } 0.7/0.3 G Max Ax/Ay Limits, 120 km/h max
